        <mxCell id="box_tab2" value="&lt;b style='font-size: 14px; color: #1E293B;'&gt;TAB 2: COST BREAKDOWN &amp;amp; VARIANCE&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;span style='font-size: 11px; color: #64748B;'&gt;3-Level Standard Cost &amp;amp; Variance Decomposition&lt;/span&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#F8FAFC;strokeColor=#94A3B8;strokeWidth=2;verticalAlign=top;align=left;spacingLeft=20;spacingTop=15;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="440" y="130" width="380" height="880" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Level 1: Executive KPI Cards -->
        <mxCell id="node_kpi_cards" value="&lt;b style='color:#0F172A;'&gt;Level 1: Executive KPI Summary&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;Total Standard Cost: &lt;b&gt;C_T = C_M + C_L + C_B&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• Baseline Std: 12.03 THB/pc&lt;br&gt;• Active Actual: 17.51 THB/pc&lt;br&gt;• Net Cost Gap: &lt;font color='#E11D48'&gt;&lt;b&gt;+5.48 THB/pc (+45.5%)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#475569;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="465" y="195" width="330" height="90" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Level 2: Variance Tree -->
        <mxCell id="node_variance_tree" value="&lt;b style='color:#0F172A;'&gt;Level 2: Variance Tree Decomposition&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#0369A1;'&gt;1. Direct Material Variance (ΔC_M):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;MPV&lt;/b&gt; (Price): (P₁ - P₀) × Q × (1 + L₁)&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;MLV&lt;/b&gt; (Loss): (L₁ - L₀) × Q × P₀&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b style='color:#0369A1;'&gt;2. Conversion Efficiency Variance (ΔC_Conv):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;LEV&lt;/b&gt; (Labor): (Runtime₁ - Runtime₀) × LR&lt;br&gt;• &lt;b&gt;BEV&lt;/b&gt; (Burden): (Runtime₁ - Runtime₀) × BR&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;i&gt;Runtime = Manning / (Capacity × Yield)&lt;/i&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#0284C7;strokeWidth=1.5;align=left;spacingLeft=12;fontSize=11;" vertex="1" parent="1">
          <mxGeometry x="465" y="315" width="330" height="195" as="geometry" />
        </mxCell>

        <!-- Level 3: Granular Itemized Breakdown -->
